cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this library, please cite the thesis below and the paper of the algorithm you use."
type: software
title: "YB18 INDS framework: incremental and asynchronous non-dominated sorting"
abstract: >-
  Java library of incremental and asynchronous non-dominated sorting for steady-state evolutionary multiobjective
  algorithms: the algorithms of I. Yakupov's PhD thesis (ITMO University, 2019), ported from the research
  repositories the thesis cites, with baselines, benchmark data and benchmarks.
authors:
  - family-names: Yakupov
    given-names: Ilya
  - family-names: Buzdalov
    given-names: Maxim
repository-code: "https://github.com/yakupov/YB18-inds-framework"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - non-dominated sorting
  - incremental non-dominated sorting
  - asynchronous algorithms
  - evolutionary multiobjective optimization
  - steady-state NSGA-II
